{
  "_doc": "Shared by tests/python/test_config.py and tests/js/config.test.mjs. Each case: a course myst.yml, a page path relative to the course root, and what both sides must compute for it (null = page is outside every content root). `notebookDir` is the folder under notebooks/. Optional `env` is the environment passed to the loaders (default {}): NMA_NOTEBOOKS_BRANCH overrides the notebooks branch; NMA_AUDIENCE sets the audience (blank means student). Optional `expect.audience` defaults to \"student\".",
